.row { display: flex; gap: 24px; padding: 30px 10px; font-family: sans-serif; }
.b { width: 80px; height: 80px; background: #4861ec; color: #fff; display: grid; place-items: center; transition: transform .4s; font-size: 14px; }
.t:hover { transform: translate(0, -20px); }
.s:hover { transform: scale(1.4); }
.r:hover { transform: rotate(45deg); }
.k:hover { transform: skew(-20deg, 0); }

.doors { display: flex; gap: 40px; padding: 30px; font: 13px sans-serif; }
.d { width: 90px; height: 90px; background: #16a34a; color: #fff; display: grid; place-items: center; transition: rotate .5s; }
.left { transform-origin: left; } .top { transform-origin: top; } .br { transform-origin: bottom right; }
.d:hover { rotate: 40deg; }

.scene { perspective: 700px; width: 180px; height: 110px; font-family: sans-serif; }
.card { position: relative; width: 100%; height: 100%; transform-style: preserve-3d; transition: transform .8s; }
.scene:hover .card { transform: rotateY(180deg); }
.face { position: absolute; inset: 0; display: grid; place-items: center; color: #fff; font-weight: bold; border-radius: 12px; backface-visibility: hidden; -webkit-backface-visibility: hidden; }
.front { background: linear-gradient(135deg,#6a11cb,#2575fc); }
.back { background: linear-gradient(135deg,#f06,#fc0); transform: rotateY(180deg); }

.stage { perspective: 600px; padding: 20px; }
.plane { width: 220px; height: 90px; background: #4861ec; color: #fff; display: grid; place-items: center; font: 14px sans-serif; transition: transform 2s linear; }
.plane:hover { transform: rotateY(180deg); }

body { font-family: sans-serif; background: #080a0c; padding: 24px; display: flex; gap: 40px; align-items: center; }
.btn { display: inline-block; width: 140px; text-align: center; padding: 10px 20px; border: 3px solid #fff; color: #fff; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold; border-radius: 5px; transition: all .5s linear; }
.btn:hover { background: #0062ff; width: 220px; box-shadow: 0 19px 38px rgba(255,255,255,.4); }
.img { width: 70px; height: 70px; background: linear-gradient(135deg,#f06,#48f); color: #fff; display: grid; place-items: center; border-radius: 10px; transition: scale 1s linear; }
.img:hover { scale: 1.3; }

body { font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 12px; }
.track { position: relative; height: 34px; background: #e2e8f0; margin-bottom: 8px; width: 320px; }
.track:hover i { transform: translateX(280px); }
i { position: absolute; top: 4px; left: 4px; width: 26px; height: 26px; background: #2965f1; border-radius: 6px; transition: transform 2s; }
.e1 { transition-timing-function: linear; }
.e2 { transition-timing-function: ease-in-out; }
.e3 { transition-timing-function: steps(5); }
span { position: absolute; right: 6px; top: 10px; color: #475569; }

.track { width: 100%; height: 120px; background: #2b3033; }
.ball { width: 60px; height: 60px; border-radius: 50%; background: #ffbb5c; margin: 20px; animation: trip 3s linear infinite alternate; box-shadow: 0 0 0 10px #353f6d; }
@keyframes trip {
  0%   { background-color: #ffbb5cb5; transform: translate(0, 0); }
  25%  { background-color: #fcbf49;   transform: translate(120px, 0); }
  50%  { background-color: #000;      transform: translate(120px, 30px); }
  75%  { background-color: #fcbf49;   transform: translate(0, 30px); }
  100% { background-color: #ffbb5cb5; transform: translate(0, 0); }
}

.b { width: 120px; padding: 12px; margin: 8px 0; background: #2965f1; color: #fff; font: 13px sans-serif; animation: grow 1.5s ease-out forwards; }
.none { animation-fill-mode: none; }
@keyframes grow { from { width: 120px; } to { width: 260px; background: #16a34a; } }

topics.description:
Most UI animations are small recipes. Learn them once and reuse them.

### 1. Spinner (rotate)
```css
@keyframes spin { to { rotate: 360deg; } }
.spinner { animation: spin 1s linear infinite; }
```

### 2. Pulse (attention)
```css
@keyframes pulse { 0%,100% { scale: 1; } 50% { scale: 1.15; } }
```
For a ripple, animate `box-shadow` from `0 0 0 0 rgba(...)` to `0 0 0 20px transparent`.

### 3. Skeleton shimmer (loading placeholders)
A gradient wider than the box slides across:
```css
.skeleton { background: linear-gradient(90deg,#eee 25%,#f8f8f8 50%,#eee 75%); background-size: 200% 100%; animation: shimmer 1.2s infinite; }
@keyframes shimmer { to { background-position: -200% 0; } }
```

### 4. Typing effect
Use `width` from `0` to `100%` with `steps()` and a blinking border.

### 5. Fade/slide in
`opacity: 0; translate: 0 20px;` -> `opacity: 1; translate: 0;` with `animation-fill-mode: both` and staggered `animation-delay`.

### 6. Bounce / shake / float
Shake uses rotate keyframes (+20deg, -20deg). Float uses `translateY` with `alternate`.

### Guidelines
- Use `transform`/`opacity` only when possible.
- Stagger with custom properties: `animation-delay: calc(var(--i) * 80ms);`
- Always add:
```css
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  *, *::before, *::after { animation-duration: .01ms !important; animation-iteration-count: 1 !important; transition-duration: .01ms !important; }
}
```

examples.css:
.row { display: flex; gap: 30px; align-items: center; }
.spin { width: 34px; height: 34px; border: 4px solid #cbd5e1; border-top-color: #2965f1; border-radius: 50%; animation: spin 1s linear infinite; }
.pulse { width: 34px; height: 34px; background: #e11d48; border-radius: 50%; animation: pulse 1.2s ease-in-out infinite; }
.dots i { display: inline-block; width: 10px; height: 10px; margin: 0 3px; background: #16a34a; border-radius: 50%; animation: bounce .8s ease-in-out infinite alternate; }
.dots i:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: .15s; } .dots i:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: .3s; }
.sk { border-radius: 6px; background: linear-gradient(90deg,#e2e8f0 25%,#f8fafc 50%,#e2e8f0 75%); background-size: 200% 100%; animation: shimmer 1.2s linear infinite; }
@keyframes spin { to { transform: rotate(360deg); } }
@keyframes pulse { 0%,100% { transform: scale(1); } 50% { transform: scale(1.25); } }
@keyframes bounce { to { transform: translateY(-12px); } }
@keyframes shimmer { to { background-position: -200% 0; } }
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { * { animation-duration: .01ms !important; animation-iteration-count: 1 !important; } }

.type { width: 19ch; font: 700 22px "Courier New", monospace; white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; border-right: 3px solid #0f172a; animation: typing 3s steps(19) infinite alternate, blink .7s step-end infinite; }
@keyframes typing { from { width: 0; } to { width: 19ch; } }
@keyframes blink { 50% { border-color: transparent; } }
